@ifnottex
@node Top
@top Wordwise

Wordwise is a reading aid inspired by (and an homage to) Amazon
Kindle's @emph{Word Wise} feature.  When @code{wordwise-mode} is
active, uncommon English words in the buffer get a short dictionary
definition displayed on a phantom line above the word, so you can keep
reading without breaking flow to look something up.

